---
title: SD-02 Catalog - Add Product (unique SKU)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor AD as Administrator
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Products API
    participant S as ProductService
    participant D as SQL Server
    AD->>F: Fill product form (name, category, SKU, price, image URL)
    F->>F: Validate required fields and price > 0
    F->>A: POST /api/products (JWT)
    A->>A: Authorize role = Administrator
    A->>S: CreateProduct(dto)
    S->>D: Check category exists and SKU / barcode unused
    D-->>S: Check result
    alt Duplicate SKU or barcode, or invalid data
        S-->>A: Business error
        A-->>F: 409 / 400 "SKU already exists"
        F-->>AD: Show inline error
    else Valid
        S->>D: Insert Product
        D-->>S: New product Id
        S-->>A: Product
        A-->>F: 201 Created
        F-->>AD: Show success and product in list
    end
    Note over S,D: The unique index on Sku also blocks concurrent duplicates
